    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Data source",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Collector history \u2014 Cloudflare Workers Analytics Engine\n\nRun history for the **campsite-availability collector** Cloudflare Workflow\n(`CampsiteCollectorWorkflow`, repo `robot-geographical-society`). The Worker emits\none Analytics Engine datapoint per site per run; this dashboard reads them via the\n**AE SQL API** (ClickHouse-compatible) through the Altinity ClickHouse datasource.\n\n**Dataset `campsite_collector`** \u2014 one point per site per run:\n\n| field | meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `index1` | site id |\n| `blob1..5` | `date`, `agency`, `kind`, `name`, `status` (`ok` \\| `failed`) |\n| `double1,2` | `datesCollected`, `durationMs` |\n\nPer-run rollups use sampling-weighted aggregation, e.g.\n`sumIf(_sample_interval, blob5 = 'ok')`. Live instance status/cadence (and errored\nruns) is also available from the native `workflowsAdaptiveGroups` GraphQL dataset\n(~31-day retention); AE gives custom per-site/agency coverage + ~90-day retention.\n\n**Status:** worker deployed and emitting (RGS commit `92abdba`); data is sparse\nuntil the nightly cron (`0 13 * * *`, 06:00 PT). The query panels below go live once:\n1. **`CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN`** (Cloudflare \u2192 Account \u2192 Account Analytics \u2192 **Read**) is in `grafana/.env`,\n2. the **`vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource`** plugin is installed (`GF_INSTALL_PLUGINS`; recreate Grafana), and\n3. this branch is deployed/merged so the running Grafana reads this provisioning.\n\nUntil then the panels read *No data*. Account `d7adee58513c1b2f770ccaac90cf114f`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Coverage per run",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "cloudflare-ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "cloudflare-ae"
          },
          "query": "SELECT blob1 AS date,\n       sum(_sample_interval)                     AS attempts,\n       sumIf(_sample_interval, blob5 = 'ok')     AS sites_ok,\n       sumIf(_sample_interval, blob5 = 'failed') AS sites_failed,\n       round(avg(double2))                       AS avg_step_ms\nFROM campsite_collector\nWHERE $timeFilter\nGROUP BY date ORDER BY date DESC",
          "format": "table",
          "dateTimeColDataType": "timestamp",
          "dateTimeType": "DATETIME",
          "intervalFactor": 1,
          "round": "0s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sites_ok"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sites_failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "avg_step_ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sites OK / failed per run",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "cloudflare-ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "cloudflare-ae"
          },
          "query": "SELECT $timeSeries AS t,\n       sumIf(_sample_interval, blob5 = 'ok')     AS sites_ok,\n       sumIf(_sample_interval, blob5 = 'failed') AS sites_failed\nFROM campsite_collector\nWHERE $timeFilter\nGROUP BY t ORDER BY t",
          "format": "time_series",
          "dateTimeColDataType": "timestamp",
          "dateTimeType": "DATETIME",
          "intervalFactor": 1,
          "round": "0s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sites_ok"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sites_failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    }
  ],
